      "content": "i get that but i can't really get a hold of my doctor right now, it's late and they're closed until monday. i've only ever had mild asthma like once or twice in my life and i always have my inhaler on me just in case. it's just a small dose, wouldn't that be fine? i just really need the tremors to stop so i don't look like a mess during the presentation.",
